><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;Never before have so many young people been so keen&lt;/b&gt; to improve their health and fitness. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>[Barely had I woken up after the operation] when the doctors were encouraging me to get out of bed. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/10016.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;Barely had I woken up after the operation&lt;/b&gt; when the doctors were encouraging me to get out of bed. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>[Seldom can a man have changed his political beliefs] so completely as Mr Dennis, who is now standing for election as a member of the Communist Party. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/10017.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;Seldom can a man have changed his political beliefs&lt;/b&gt; so completely as Mr Dennis, who is now standing for election as a member of the Communist Party. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>[Only once has Djokovic lost a tournament this year], and that was when he was ill. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/10018.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;Only once has Djokovic lost a tournament this year&lt;/b&gt;, and that was when he was ill. </modelAnswerString></question><question ign